{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3fbcd604-850f-8916-a1ab-29770d10d58b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T11:25:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Raj Mensah",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:22:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:22:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning! I'm looking for the Naval base housing office. Is this the housing office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:22:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no, hon, this is the City Clerk at Newport City Hall. I think you've got the wrong number for that one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:23:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The what? City Hall? I'm sorry, you'll have to speak up, my ears aren't what they were."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:23:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. This is City Hall, the City Clerk's office. Not the Navy housing office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:23:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, City Hall. Well, that's my mistake. I'm dialing off an old list, I think the list is older than I am. [pause] And that's saying something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:23:33-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Those old lists will do that to you. The base has its own offices, and they're not run through the city. I'd call the main base operator and ask them to connect you to housing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The base operator. Okay. And do you happen to have that number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:23:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have it in front of me here, but it should be on the base's website, or you could check a current phone book or call information. That'll be more up to date than your list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:24:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Information, yes, I can do that. I don't do the computer much. My phone is the kind that stays on the wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:24:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nothing wrong with that. Are you calling about something with your house? Is it something we might help with here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, it's about the housing office. I had some branches down after that storm, the one Friday into Saturday, and I wanted to ask them about it. I'm cleaning it up myself, slowly. The fellow next door lets me use his wheelbarrow, so that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:24:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's a good neighbor. Plenty of folks are still hauling stuff three days later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:24:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What was that? Three days?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:24:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said a lot of people are still cleaning up, three days later."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Okay. So I call the base operator, not you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. The base operator will point you to housing. And if you ever need something from City Hall, you've got us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:25:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know. Thank you very much, young lady. Sorry to bother you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:25:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bother at all. Take care, and good luck with the cleanup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T11:25:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye now."
    }
  ],
